### Gateway Dynamic Routing Playground
### Gateway runs on http://localhost:8080 (single public entry point)

@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Catalog Products - List (routed to CATALOG-SERVICE)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products
Accept: application/json

### 2. Catalog Products - Filter by search & category (routed to CATALOG-SERVICE)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products?search=Keyboard&category=CAT-ELECTRONICS&page=0&size=20
Accept: application/json

### 3. Catalog Products - Get by ID (routed to CATALOG-SERVICE)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Catalog Products - Create new product (routed to CATALOG-SERVICE)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "sku": "PROD-WIRELESS-MOUSE",
  "name": "Wireless Ergonomic Mouse",
  "description": "2.4GHz wireless ergonomic optical mouse",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "unitId": 1
}

### 5. Catalog Categories - List (routed to CATALOG-SERVICE)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/categories
Accept: application/json

### 6. Warehouse - List warehouses (routed to WAREHOUSE-SERVICE)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses
Accept: application/json

### 7. Warehouse - Get warehouse by ID (routed to WAREHOUSE-SERVICE)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses/1
Accept: application/json

### 8. Warehouse Locations - List locations (routed to WAREHOUSE-SERVICE)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses/1/locations
Accept: application/json

### 9. Warehouse Locations - Create location (routed to WAREHOUSE-SERVICE)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses/1/locations
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "AISLE-01-SHELF-B"
}

### 10. Safeguard Check: Gateway's own actuator health (handled locally, UP)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 11. Safeguard Check: Unrouted unknown path (expects 404 from Gateway)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/unknown
Accept: application/json

### 12. Safeguard Check: Downstream internal actuator leak prevention (expects 404)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products/actuator/env
Accept: application/json
